						ROTARACT 	




							
About the Club

The Rotaract Club at CHRIST (Deemed to be University), Lavasa Campus (RaC CUL), is a dynamic student-led platform committed to service, leadership, and personal development. Aligned with the values of Rotary International, the club empowers students to become responsible citizens and compassionate leaders through impactful community engagement and collaborative initiatives. By organizing social drives, awareness campaigns, leadership workshops, and campus-wide events, RaC CUL nurtures innovation, empathy, teamwork, and professional excellence. With the motto “Together we’ll rise, with service and wise,” the club continues to build a legacy of service-driven leadership.

