						AVIAN ALLIES	




							
About the Club

Founded in September 2023, Avian Allies is the official birders’ club of CHRIST (Deemed to be University), Pune Lavasa Campus. The club offers a rich mix of nature walks, birding trails, discussions, and hands-on workshops designed to deepen understanding of the avian world. Beyond the joy of birdwatching, Avian Allies works to broaden awareness of local bird species, strengthen connections within the birding community, disseminate vital conservation information, and foster environmental consciousness. It has grown into a vibrant community for those passionate about birds and bird conservation, operating across multiple creative and educational verticals.

