						QUEST REACH	




							
About the Club

Quest Reach is a university-level Research Club dedicated to fostering a strong research-oriented culture among students. The club empowers members by providing structured guidance on research methodologies, academic writing, interdisciplinary collaboration, patent filing, and publication processes. Through mentorship, workshops, and hands-on research engagement, Quest Reach enables students to understand the significance of research in both academic and professional growth. By nurturing curiosity, innovation, and intellectual rigor, the club actively contributes to strengthening the university’s research ecosystem and academic excellence.

