						EQUESTRIAN 	




							
About the Club

The Christ Equestrian Club at CHRIST (Deemed to be University), Pune Lavasa Campus, offers students a unique opportunity to explore and excel in the art of horsemanship. Established in 2025, the club provides a welcoming environment for both beginners and experienced riders who share a passion for equestrian sports. Through structured training, expert guidance, and collaborative learning, members develop discipline, leadership, resilience, and a deep respect for animals. The club emphasizes physical fitness, mental well-being, and ethical animal interaction while nurturing sportsmanship and camaraderie. With access to professional facilities and experienced instructors, the Equestrian Club fosters holistic growth and opens pathways to careers in equestrian sports and allied fields.

