The Global Academic Club is a student-driven initiative dedicated to expanding international academic exposure and global learning opportunities. Working closely with the Office of International Affairs, the club introduces curated summer and winter school programs, exchange opportunities, and global collaborations that enable students to make informed decisions about higher education abroad. By fostering cross-cultural learning and global networking, the club empowers students to broaden their academic horizons and build strong foundations for future academic and professional success.

