						PHOTOGRAPHY 	




							
About the Club

FOCUS is the Photography Club of the institution, founded on the belief that every individual carries a unique visual perspective. The club serves as a creative platform for both beginners and experienced photography enthusiasts to explore technical skills, visual storytelling, and artistic expression. Through themed photo-walks, creative challenges, collaborative projects, and exhibitions, FOCUS encourages members to capture meaningful moments and transform ordinary scenes into compelling visual narratives. Beyond photography, the club fosters connection, confidence, collaboration, and artistic growth, making it a vibrant community driven by creativity and imagination.

